sentences.text:
In case of offence committed by the company under the provisions of the Act , a person, who has been nominated, under sub-section (2) of Section 17 of the Act to be in charge of and responsible to, the company for the conduct of the business of the company and in case of absence of such nomination every person, at the time of commission of offence, was in charge or responsible for the conduct of the business of the company and the company itself is considered guilty for committing the offence and liable to be proceeded against and punished accordingly;
however in the present case, the company has not been made accused, so in absence of the company,
being arraigned as an accused, no other officers of the company can be held criminally liable.
